  "label": "goat meat consumption is mapped to goats in a pen",
  "description": "The top text 'goat meat is very popular' is analogically mapped onto the visual of goats in a pen, implying that the goats represent the source of the popular meat. The visual of the goats (their rear ends prominently visible) is used to symbolize the meat itself, creating a direct visual-textual link where the goats are the 'entity' being referred to by the text.",
